.build-cache/
*.log
*.test
*.out
*.prof
build/
data/

# Performance test generated artifacts
test/performance/openraft/target/
test/performance/perfcompare
test/performance/perfcompare.remote

# test/performance/profiles/ is NOT ignored. It was, back when it was scratch
# output. It now holds the measured data of record: the stored result JSON, the
# machine specifications captured on each target, the generated comparison
# documents, and analysis.md — including the R640 baseline, whose machine is
# offline and whose numbers exist nowhere else.

# Snapshot trees a test accidentally rooted at the package directory instead of
# t.TempDir(). Ignored so they can never be committed again; a test that needs
# one must create it under t.TempDir().
pkg/shard-*/

# AI session handoff notes
resume.txt

.serena
go.work
go.work.sum

# Analysers built by `make install-lint`. Repo-local so `make lint` runs a
# binary built with this repo's Go, rather than whatever GOPATH/bin happens to
# hold -- a correctly pinned golangci-lint built by an older Go cannot analyse
# this module at all (#118).
.tools/

# Module credentials for the benchmark image builds: the four variables of
# ../handbook/software/conventions/dependency-resolution.md section 6, read by
# the perf-* targets. A token lives in no checkout, ever (version-control.md 4).
.devcontainer/.env
